  Description: Whether you're employed by a military organization to decipher coded
    messages sent by enemy factions or work independently to crack an enigma created
    by a past civilization, you have a head for patterns and linguistics. You might
    even use new clockwork devices to aid you in your efforts. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Society skill and the Cryptography Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Glean Contents] skill feat.
